//      substituent examples like c1ccc(N=C=O)cc1).
//   2. Check BOTH "N=C=O" AND "O=C=N" for isocyanate presence. Attempt 9 only
//      checked "N=C=O", silently failing on canonical "O=C=N…" format SMILES and
//      forcing unnecessary continued generation that sometimes hit EOS without close.
//   3. Keep penalty=4.0, commonTokens=["C","CC","O"], phase1=6 tokens, T=1.6
//      for phase2, GroupBoostedConstrainedStep for phase3 — exactly as attempt 9.
//
