//
//   Loop — phase1 (SafePenalizedConstrainedStep): same hard-mask postcondition;
//     AppendConstrainedToken preserves validity. ✓
//
//   Loop — phase2 (SafeTemperatureConstrainedStep): same hard-mask. ✓
//
//   Loop — phase3 (GroupBoostedConstrainedStep): same hard-mask. ✓
//
//   Post-loop CloseSpanWithinBudget: postcondition guarantees
//     insideOut ==> parser.IsValidPrefix(currentOut). ✓
//
// Invariant 2 (progress): |generated| <= |generatedPrefix| + steps
//
//   OpenConstrainedSpan: steps += 1, |generated| += 1 for "<<".
